@crew holt
// Head writer 4: career lines. Holt walks every deck before breakfast; he notices who isn't where they should be.
== career.worried
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.missed
- Walked past the Works bay at eight. You weren't in it. Fix that.
? tier>=friend flag:career.bottom
- I've seen people let go. Don't be one. Tomorrow, eight. I'll check.   #serious
== career.bye
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.lastday
- Leaving. Hm. Do better on the next one. You've got it in you.
